Package: fitro360-relay
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18) | nodejs-18 | nodejs-20
Maintainer: Fitro360 <support@fitro360.com>
Description: Fitro360 on-prem relay agent
 Polls the Fitro360 cloud for queued biometric device commands and
 executes them on devices on the local gym LAN. Authenticates with
 a per-device serial + secret using HMAC-SHA256.
